{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41436","headline":"阙下偶书寄孙员外 · 李建勳","name":"阙下偶书寄孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安驱驰地，贵贱共悠悠。\n白日谁相促，劳生自不休。\n凤翔双阙晓，蝉噪六街秋。\n独有南宫客，时来话钓舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}